### Runtime & Modules
- ESM only (`"type": "module"`). Use `import`/`export`; avoid `require`.
- Targets Node and Cloudflare Workers. Guard Node-only APIs from worker paths.

### Dev & Run
- `npm run dev` — Cloudflare Worker at `src/index.ts`
- `npm run dev:node` — Node server at `src/start-server.ts`
- `npm run start:node` — Run built Node server `build/start-server.js`

### Build & Deploy
- `npm run build` — Rollup bundles library and worker
- `npm run build-plugins` — Build `plugins/**`
- `npm run deploy` — Deploy Workers (`wrangler deploy src/index.ts`)

### Tests & Quality
- `npm run test:gateway` — Jest for `src/**`
- `npm run test:plugins` — Jest for `plugins/**`
- `npm run format` / `npm run format:check` — Prettier

### Repo Roles (see `02-structure-entrypoints`)
- `src/index.ts`: Worker entry
- `src/start-server.ts`: Node entry
- `src/handlers/**`, `src/middlewares/**`, `src/services/**`, `src/providers/**`, `src/types/**`, `src/utils/**`

@package.json
@tsconfig.json
@src/index.ts
@src/start-server.ts
